    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world, the cat tribe is universally disliked by all living beings. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A silver-haired woman is seeking a way to coexist with the cat tribe. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This story is about their \u201clittle adventure to realize the world they envision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201d The story is heartwarming throughout and is aimed at a wide range of players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25a0 Everything is made up of small elements </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is composed of \u201clittle\u201d elements in every aspect. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can enjoy small maps, small discoveries, and small stories in a short amount of time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25a0 Growth System</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not only do characters have levels, but weapons and armor also have growth elements. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Especially for weapons, equipping and fighting with them will level them up just like the characters, adding more fun to the battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25a0 Collection Elements </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many treasures and animals are hidden in places that are not immediately obvious, allowing you to explore and find them. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each map also contains materials that can be collected to craft and enhance weapons and armor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you have an urgent matter, please send a DM to @ArtWorkers_0511 (X account).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cControls\u201d </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I strongly recommend using an Xbox controller. The controls for mouse and keyboard are as follows:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A, S, D, W (\u2190\u2193\u2192\u2191): Move character/cursor</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Z, Space, Return: Investigate, Attack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >X, Backspace: Cancel</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Esc: Open Menu</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1~3: Use Skills</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only the camera rotation uses the mouse.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world, the cat tribe is universally disliked by all living beings. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A silver-haired woman is seeking a way to coexist with the cat tribe. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This story is about their \u201clittle adventure to realize the world they envision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201d The story is heartwarming throughout and is aimed at a wide range of players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25a0 Everything is made up of small elements </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is composed of \u201clittle\u201d elements in every aspect. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can enjoy small maps, small discoveries, and small stories in a short amount of time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25a0 Growth System</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not only do characters have levels, but weapons and armor also have growth elements. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Especially for weapons, equipping and fighting with them will level them up just like the characters, adding more fun to the battles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u25a0 Collection Elements </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many treasures and animals are hidden in places that are not immediately obvious, allowing you to explore and find them. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each map also contains materials that can be collected to craft and enhance weapons and armor.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you have an urgent matter, please send a DM to @ArtWorkers_0511 (X account).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cControls\u201d </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I strongly recommend using an Xbox controller. The controls for mouse and keyboard are as follows:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A, S, D, W (\u2190\u2193\u2192\u2191): Move character/cursor</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Z, Space, Return: Investigate, Attack</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >X, Backspace: Cancel</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Esc: Open Menu</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1~3: Use Skills</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only the camera rotation uses the mouse.</p>",
    "short_description": "This is a single-player RPG where you can enjoy the basic elements of combat, collection, exploration, and growth. The game offers a simple experience composed of \u201clittle\u201d elements, and the charming interactions between the cute characters are also a highlight.",
